decision_conditions:
Condition : 2 - Details and samples of all facing materials to buildings within the development hereby permitted shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority prior to commencement of the development. The samples and details shall include: 
- cladding materials (including system specifications/details); - window treatment (including sections and reveals); 
- obscure glazing details (where relevant);
- fixings and flashing; and   - any other materials/details to be used.
The development shall be carried out strictly in accordance with the details so approved and maintained as such thereafter.
